 "solution": "\\(4^{\\frac12}=\\sqrt4=2\\)。\n\\(\\log_2\\dfrac12=\\log_2 2^{-1}=-1\\)。\n\\(f\\left(\\dfrac12\\right)=2+(-1)=1\\)。",
